460
00:17:46,566 --> 00:17:49,035
I'VE BEEN WORKING ON IT
FOR MONTHS, BUT IT'S JUST--

461
00:17:49,035 --> 00:17:51,904
IT'S EASIER TO LOSE WEIGHT
THAN IT IS TO GAIN WEIGHT.

462
00:17:56,943 --> 00:17:58,911
Tyra: I DO FEEL LIKE
YOU ARE TOO THIN.

463
00:17:58,911 --> 00:18:02,114
OF COURSE, PEOPLE KNOW THAT
FASHION MODELS ARE SLENDER,

464
00:18:02,114 --> 00:18:04,884
BUT YOUR BODY, I THINK,
DOES SEND A LITTLE NEGATIVE

465
