THOSE SHAKES, GIRL.

469
00:18:10,189 --> 00:18:11,691
I EAT BARBECUE RIBS
AND POTATO SALAD,

470
00:18:11,691 --> 00:18:13,025
AND THAT'S
WHAT GAVE ME THIS ASS.

471
00:18:13,025 --> 00:18:14,860
