472
00:18:14,860 --> 00:18:17,697
Amy: IT WAS ALL REALLY GOOD
CONSTRUCTIVE CRITICISM.

473
00:18:20,499 --> 00:18:22,468
Josie: HEY, Y'ALL.
THIS IS BABY.

474
00:18:22,468 --> 00:18:24,637
HE JUST REALLY WANTED
TO MEET TYRA.

475
00:18:24,637 --> 00:18:27,273
Brianna: I WANNA BE A MODEL
OR A DANCER, ACTUALLY.

476
00:18:27,273 --> 00:18:28,240
