A MODEL?

477
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:30,042
Woman: PEOPLE TELL ME
I'M BEAUTIFUL ON A DAILY BASIS.

478
00:18:30,042 --> 00:18:31,978
Woman #2: I HAVE THE SPIRIT
AND THE SPUNK.

479
00:18:31,978 --> 00:18:33,846
I DON'T HAVE BOOBS,
UNFORTUNATELY.

480
00:18:33,846 --> 00:18:35,348
Woman: I'M USED TO BEING,
LIKE, THE PRETTIEST ONE

481
00:18:35,348 --> 00:18:36,082
AT MY SCHOOL.

482
00:18:36,082 --> 00:18:39,051
Woman #3: I'M A WHIP-ASS,
