489
00:18:49,595 --> 00:18:51,731
Kimberly: I LOVE MY NOSE,
MY NOSE IS BIG AND BEAUTIFUL.

490
00:18:51,731 --> 00:18:53,733
I CAN SMELL THINGS THAT PEOPLE
CANNOT SMELL.

491
00:18:54,767 --> 00:18:55,334
Woman #2: I DON'T KNOW.

492
00:18:55,334 --> 00:18:57,269
I JUST DON'T THINK
THIS IS THAT GREAT FOR ME.

493
00:18:57,269 --> 00:18:58,337
I DON'T WANNA DO IT.

494
00:18:58,337 --> 00:18:59,739
- J.: OOH.
