498
00:19:10,950 --> 00:19:12,785
- Tyra: HI, LEAH.
- Leah: HI.

499
00:19:12,785 --> 00:19:13,986
- Tyra: HOW ARE YOU?
- Leah: I'M GREAT.

500
00:19:13,986 --> 00:19:15,187
MY NAME IS LEAH.

501
00:19:15,187 --> 00:19:18,224
I'M 24, AND I WAS BORN
AND RAISED IN OKLAHOMA.

502
00:19:18,224 --> 00:19:19,425
HOLY CRAP, I'M HERE.

503
00:19:19,425 --> 00:19:21,594
I'M, LIKE, THIS FARM GIRL WITH--
