ABOVE MY HEAD.

542
00:20:43,442 --> 00:20:46,178
CHIN LITTLE BIT LOWER
AND LOOK ABOVE MY HEAD.

543
00:20:46,178 --> 00:20:48,114
- J.: BEAUTIFUL EYES.
- Amanda: THANK YOU.

544
00:20:48,114 --> 00:20:51,650
- Tyra: THANK YOU, AMANDA.
- Jay: THANK YOU.

545
00:20:51,650 --> 00:20:53,185
Tyra: HER EYES
ARE BREATHTAKING.

546
00:20:53,185 --> 00:20:54,520
